      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-02-08T06:27:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So just played a fun game against Akash’bhuta in Sikver Gultch, with Captain Cosmic, Redeemer Fanatic, Tempest, O-X, and Sky-Scraper. Akash nuked our early setup, then brought out about 6 limbs (fortunately mostly Carapaces).  Then Sky-Scraper used her agression modulator on the Explosives Wagon, and used her giant power to deal 3 damage to each limb, and then took out the wagon.  The wagon proceeded to abolutely destroy Akash’bhuta, while barely tapping the heroes.  Then SS finished her collateral damage without the wagon’s damage boost.  All in all a good turn.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:40.877Z",
